@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center ZoomLevel:2
@Wait WaitMode:0.2

[PrintTextModified Text:"（犯人がした行動……<br>　もしくはしたかもしれない行為……。<br>　それがわかれば……！）|#0101Trial09_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal2,ArmR1_2,ArmL5,Eyes2_Normal_Open1,Mouth2_Angry_Open2
@GosubToSplitPerspectiveStageScreens Index:1 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:……エマさん。<br>皆さんの言った言葉が、ヒントになるかもしれません……！|#0101Trial09_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Normal_Middle
[PrintTextModified Text:"うん……！ みんなの発言……きちんと聞いてみるね！|#0101Trial09_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true Wait:true

@GotoModified Path:.Judge1-9-1

